"The customer and every supplier of a file are rated from 0 to 10 before its operations close (F0-C66, as in Odoo 17 since 01/03/2025)."
msgstr ""
"El cliente y cada proveedor de un expediente se valoran de 0 a 10 antes del cierre operativo (F0-C66, como en Odoo 17 desde el 01/03/2025)."

#. module: boss_expediente
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:boss_expediente.boss_expediente_view_form
