"The customer and every supplier the file bought from, from 0\n"
"                                (very bad) to 10 (excellent), before operations close (as in Odoo 17). Their average is shown\n"
"                                on the contact and in «Services to buy»."
msgstr ""
"El cliente y cada proveedor al que compró el expediente, de 0 (muy malo) a 10 (excelente), antes del cierre operativo (como en Odoo 17). Su media se ve en el contacto y en «Servicios a comprar»."

